{"server":"en","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_08_beg","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_08","title":"Infiltration Battle","storyCode":"OD-8","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"6ee7ba1d01cb159856e059c1bdf19787a39206c1f1a83460f32c7ea18c5c0a94","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_labentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Rangers's map stops here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"It's all up to us now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"Who knew this cave would be so big?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"It's like the ground beneath the town is completely hollow."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Are the explosives okay?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"We've got the strongest batch from the safehouse here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"I hope Lord's plan works."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm afraid it won't be that simple. Look there..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"...I hope it's not what I think it is..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Originiutant Infected","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"Gaa..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"That's... a person?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Originiutant Infected","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"Gaa..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"Whatever it is, it's going to die and that's enough."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"I won't be surprised at whatever *profanity* showing up now..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Keep moving! Don't get caught up in a fight with them. We don't have time to waste in here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_labcorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"...Why would Long Spring have a facility like this underneath it?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"Cohen... Where are we?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"I knew it! *profanity*, I knew it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"So this is where most of the lab ended up."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Now that I think about it, we were too careless."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"We've lived in this town for so long and we had no idea at all."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"It's that psycho behind all this."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"What's that smell...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"What else could it be? That's the smell of death."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Stay frosty. And close."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"What are these?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"Cages? So many?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"All corpses... people and beasts together..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"This is the work of Lev Klitschko, a man both mad and cruel beyond imagination. I never should've tried to take him alive. He should have a bullet in his head."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"Your typical madman wouldn't do something this awful."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"Wait."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"...There's someone alive in that cage."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Heh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Look who's here?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"It's that Drudge character."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"I'd recognize the *profanity* anywhere."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, it's you. The mercenaries."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm so glad to see you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I know we've had our differences in the past... but let's set them aside for now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I have a feeling you're looking for that scientist... and I know where he is."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We've got a common enemy. And the enemy of my enemy is my friend."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"So brazen I'm sick to my stomach."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"That Feline over there, I know you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Your skills are pretty easily recognizable. And one can hear a lot in the mercenary market in Columbia."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You are a killer, aren't you?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island hired you, meaning even they have quite some dirty work to do."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Compared to others, you must know better how to weigh up the pros and cons. Let's have a talk, shall we?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"Shut up. Or I can help you with that."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Shame. I thought people like you would be more realistic."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Open the cage."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"What...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't worry about it. Just open the cage."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"Got it."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Good call. We all know the score."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Yeah. I sure do."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hold on, what are you doing?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Agh!!!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Hey! You crazy..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"You..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Help me......please......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Please..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Drudge","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Please... stop."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hah. You can still talk. Guess I'm not done."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"And this one's for Dr. Miarow."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"Okay, okay, he's had enough."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Phew..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"You went a little overboard there."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"What... you feel bad for him?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"Man, you almost killed him."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"Totally rearranged his face."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"Save your strength. We've still got work to do."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"You're right."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"Pfft."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"What happened?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"Nothing. I'm just feeling a lot more relaxed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"You know what? Me too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"If he's locked up in here, he must be part of Lev's plan."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm not surprised."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lab"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't see anyone here..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"Might be an ambush ahead. Keep cautious."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Well well well, look who it is. More visitors to my laboratory?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It's been a while, my friends from Team Rainbow."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You're just in time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"No... you always come at precisely the right time."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Tch."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't bother. It's bulletproof glass."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I applaud your decisiveness, squeezing the trigger without hesitation. Don't even wait for an end to our little prologue here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But we have a show to put on. A great opening requires a great audience, and a complete opening dialogue."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Today is a day of praise for the great work of the Creator. And that Creator is none other than yours truly."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Creator? That's quite a title you've given yourself."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"You're a *profanity* psycho!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Psycho... hah. The mediocre always use this word to describe ideas and concepts they cannot understand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Behold this world!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Completely different chemistry... totally inverted laws of physics... the flower of science blooms in exploration and doubt. And the most fertile soil lies in the land of the unknown!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"And now, I have succeeded."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you see? Can you feel? The surface appearance is similar, but it all functions on radically different principles!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"This is the evolution of life. This is the iteration of existence."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Originium is the truth of this world. You should accept that. Don't fear it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Welcome to the future."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't you have even the slightest moral compunction over what you're doing?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"What does human life even mean to you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Human nature is weak, good and evil are subjective definitions of weakness, and what we call guilt is but one of the myriad cognitive signals produced by the brain."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"And the science I pursue is never swayed by such flimsy concepts."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't delude yourselves that even in this world you still bind your minds with these meaningless ideas."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Even electronic information technology and nuclear energy were originally designed to help us kill each other more effectively."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Would you add a new layer of definition to science? Force everything to fit your fragile spiritual needs?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Nonsense."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But I forgive you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You don't have to understand. I'll allow you to go on, unknowing. Primitive thinking is a common form of ignorance. It's not your fault, and I forgive you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"That's the end of my speech. And in addition to my forgiveness, I also offer you my thanks for waiting so patiently."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Now it is time for praise. Give your praise to this entirely new life form."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Levi","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Praise be! Praise be! Praise be!!!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"No matter what, we absolutely can't let that thing make it to the surface."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"You stall it! I'll get the bomb ready!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_456_ash","aliases":["Ash"]},{"speakerId":"char_457_blitz","aliases":["Blitz"]}]}
